OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity plans #40m cuts amid
OL,4,A'visa refusals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university is aiming to make #40m
OL,7,Fcuts to its budget within a year as it
OL,8,Fgrapples with visa changes that
OL,9,Fthreaten a major reduction in income
OL,10,Ffrom foreign students.
OL,12,FThe University of Sunderland, which is
OL,13,Falso embroiled in a row over its
OL,14,Fcost-cutting closure of the National
OL,15,FGlass Centre, said significant
OL,16,Ffinancial pressures were exacerbated by
OL,17,Fthe "impact of increased visa
OL,18,Frefusals".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
