OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity plans #40m cuts amid
OL,4,A'visa refusals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn email to staff, seen by the BBC,
OL,7,Fsaid cuts must come from "both staff
OL,8,Fand non-staff costs, and must be
OL,9,Frecurrent and permanent".
OL,11,FA university spokesperson said: "We are
OL,12,Fworking with staff across the
OL,13,Funiversity to identify where we can
OL,14,Freduce costs, without compromising
OL,15,Fstudent experience."
